# The agentic loop's model, version 1 (agentic-loop s-3ddb3e87): our Gemma 4 E4B
# GGUF (metis-agent go/models, the Q5_K_M the specialist's S1b ran), imported — nothing is
# downloaded. The chat template and the tool-call grammar are Ollama's built-in
# Gemma 4 renderer and parser (ollama 0.24.0: Gemma4Renderer / Gemma4Parser), the
# same turn format the go adapter and py/metis_agent/gemma4.py write by hand.
#   ollama create metis-gemma4-e4b -f ollama/Modelfile        (from this checkout; the GGUF is metis-agent's)
FROM ../../metis-agent/go/models/gemma4/gemma-4-E4B-it-Q5_K_M.gguf
RENDERER gemma4
PARSER gemma4
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 64
PARAMETER stop "<eos>"
